# When another program removes projects while the Navigator is open, it relists what is left and Enter goes to a remaining entry.
file <<END
Alpha:
	- a
Beta:
	- b
END
keys <C-g> <Down> <Down> <Down> <Down> <Down> <Down> <Down> <Down>
see │▌ Beta
outside <<END
Solo:
	- s
END
see Solo
hide Beta
keys <Enter>
hide Navigator
quit
saved <<END
Solo:
	- s
END
